ァ。水性ペンキだから、すぐ落ちっから怒んなって！」\n「マシュマロあるからスモア食おーぜ。誰か一緒に焼くか？」\n(数秒ほど間を置く)\n「……なんか、忘れてるんだよ。少なくとも、ここにはただの成り行きで来たわけじゃ、ないんだよ。ただ、なんだったか、わかんねぇ……」(もし可能でしたら最後二つのセリフはノイズ加工などございますと嬉しいです)\n\nhttps://twitter.com/TetoriR_story/status/1330476295675756544?s=19", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 147479, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "彩無色(ｲﾛﾄﾞﾘﾑｼｷ)👑🍄まのさば⚖️実況中", "screen_name": "musiki_649", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2039178084528893952/URR7lW7h.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1060573478850486272/1674068314/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 593339, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "桜なごみ(Nagomi Sakura)💮✡️圧倒的清楚", "screen_name": "sakura_n753", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1642533909949992961/W2RtVwz4.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1278265863284461568/1644851435/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1350640, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "菓子宮🍭🏰", "screen_name": "kashimiyavoice1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1564909468613107712/rnBZLt7p.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1093181025956417536/1661938613/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": n